<title>ITALY: Bank of Italy sets 4.5 trln lire reverse repo.</title>
<headline>Bank of Italy sets 4.5 trln lire reverse repo.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Italy said it called a 4.5 trillion lire reverse repurchase tender for Thursday for government securities to be resold on Oct 23.</p>
<p>At the previous comparable operation for 9.0 trillion lire on Oct 15, the maximum accepted rate stood at 8.60 percent and the average rate at 8.56 percent.</p>
</text>
